      "content": "okay i get that but i'm not really a big fan of bland food... it's gonna be hard to stick to a diet if i cant have any flavor lol. like, is there a certain amount of it that is safe? can i have like a little bit of cheese on a sandwich or just avoid it completely? i feel like i can handle a little bit of soy sauce if i don't overdo it.",
